&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A career driven by you.&lt;/strong&gt; Join AutoScout24 Group and experience life in the fast lane. We’re not just leading the market; we’re creating it. For a career that doesn’t stand still, where you can put your ideas in the driving seat and change the way the world moves, join our global community.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly experienced &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to lead the strategy, design, delivery, and operational excellence of integrations, automations, and enterprise platform initiatives across ERP, Billing, Revenue, CRM, HRIS systems. This role requires a strong technical and people leader with deep expertise in enterprise systems, data flows, platform modernization, migration programs, and large-scale delivery execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and delivery of enterprise integrations and automation solutions across ERP, Billing, Revenue, CRM, HRIS, and related platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define scalable integration patterns, system interfaces, API strategies, data flows, and engineering standards across enterprise applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply an AI-first approach to solution development by identifying opportunities to improve automation, operational efficiency, insights, and engineering productivity through AI-enabled capabilities where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure AI-enabled solutions are implemented responsibly, with appropriate governance, security, explainability, and alignment to business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead system migration initiatives, including transition planning, cutover strategy, dependency mapping, risk management, and business continuity considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data archival and retention strategies, ensuring compliance, accessibility, cost efficiency, and operational integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead system decommissioning efforts, including impact assessment, transition planning, historical data preservation, and retirement of legacy capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the design and support of data pipelines that enable reliable movement, transformation, and availability of business-critical data across systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support business reporting and analytical needs by ensuring enterprise data is trusted, well-structured, and accessible for decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage end-to-end execution of integration and platform programs, including planning, prioritization, dependency management, issue resolution, and delivery oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and enforce deployment, release, and rollback plans to ensure safe production changes, minimal disruption, and rapid recovery when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead engineering resources by providing technical direction, coaching, mentorship, and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business and technology stakeholders to translate complex requirements into practical, scalable, and maintainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish best practices for documentation, monitoring, support readiness, operational governance, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure solutions are secure, reliable, maintainable, and aligned with enterprise standards and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education, Experience &amp;amp; Technical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in software engineering, enterprise systems, integrations, or business systems technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant engineering management experience with strong ownership of team leadership, delivery execution, stakeholder alignment, and technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing, troubleshooting, and supporting software systems such as Billing, Revenue, CRM, ERP, HRIS, and related enterprise platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad expertise in database technologies, including enterprise data modeling, transactional and analytical data structures, data storage, performance optimization, and data lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with scripting and automation technologies used to support integrations, operational processes, batch workloads, and platform support activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with reporting, analytics, and enterprise data consumption patterns, including the delivery of trusted data for operational and business insight needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of integration patterns, APIs, middleware, event-driven and service-based architectures, and enterprise automation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering and supporting real-time and batch integration solutions across a variety of enterprise technology environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with data pipelines, transformation processes, orchestration, and system-to-system synchronization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of software design principles and the ability to design systems at both conceptual and detailed levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern API technology stacks, including web services, service contracts, payload formats, authentication, and enterprise integration standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with system migration, production releases, deployment planning, rollback strategies, and operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills with the ability to influence, negotiate, and align technology initiatives with business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively with technical experts across enterprise, digital, and business platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive mindset with strong attention to detail and a high sense of ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to structure teamwork, create clarity, and drive accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong conflict management, problem-solving, and resolution skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance strategic planning with hands-on delivery leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills across engineering, operations, data, product, and business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated AI-first and innovation-oriented mindset, with the ability to evaluate emerging technologies pragmatically and apply them to real business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
